      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "lbl-notes-desc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 1475,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 95,
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "boundElements": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "am",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "1. Layered Domain Isolation: Clear vertical isolation across Auth, Items, Matching, and AI domains guarantees independent testability.\n2. Event-Driven Decoupling: LostItemService & FoundItemService emit Spring ApplicationEvents; CandidateMatchService evaluates pairs asynchronously.\n3. Multimodal Dynamic Rebalancing: 6-dimensional scoring automatically re-normalizes weights to 100% when visual embeddings or coordinates are missing.\n4. Resilient Universal AI: All AI features route through LlmClientRouter with automatic degradation to MockLlmClient if Gemini/OpenAI API keys are unset.\n5. Production Persistence: Spring Data JPA manages entity lifecycle, while ImageStorageService handles local disk image persistence.",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1842929963,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "1. Layered Domain Isolation: Clear vertical isolation across Auth, Items, Matching, and AI domains guarantees independent testability.\n2. Event-Driven Decoupling: LostItemService & FoundItemService emit Spring ApplicationEvents; CandidateMatchService evaluates pairs asynchronously.\n3. Multimodal Dynamic Rebalancing: 6-dimensional scoring automatically re-normalizes weights to 100% when visual embeddings or coordinates are missing.\n4. Resilient Universal AI: All AI features route through LlmClientRouter with automatic degradation to MockLlmClient if Gemini/OpenAI API keys are unset.\n5. Production Persistence: Spring Data JPA manages entity lifecycle, while ImageStorageService handles local disk image persistence.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1791572786284,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 965649669,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
