      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "6-Dimensional Scoring Pipeline:\n• Visual (35%): 512-dim cosine similarity\n• Category (20%) & Attributes (20%)\n• Text (10%): Jaccard token similarity\n• Geo (10%): Haversine distance & city\n• Temporal (5%): Time-decay curve",
